      "summary": "Initial taxonomy: ABIM IM blueprint categories plus the app's tracks and planned ancillary specialties."
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "date": "2026-10-25",
      "summary": "Specialty independence: Primary Care, Pediatrics and a separate Critical Care Medicine; unknown folders are proposed specialties awaiting owner review."
