  "note": "Knowledge Granularity Model level 1-2 (Specialty > Domain). Domains are the ABIM blueprint subcategories, loaded from the blueprint registries at ingest (dom.<abim_code>.<slug>), plus domains added by ingestion. A Drive folder name resolves to a specialty through folder_aliases (case-insensitive); an unknown top-level folder becomes a proposed specialty (status 'modified', governance pending_validation, `proposed` record) awaiting owner review (`specialty_review`), never an error and never assigned silently: its sources keep no specialty until the owner approves it or merges it into an existing one.",
